# Inline union annotation in function signature using the `or` combinator.
# A function that returns @[or Integer String] can return either Int or String.
[
  to-int-or-str: [fn@[or Integer String] [let n@Integer]
    [if [= n 0] 0 "nonzero"]]
  v1: [to-int-or-str 0]
  v2: [to-int-or-str 1]
]
=== out
["to-int-or-str": [fn [let n] ...]  "v1": "nonzero"  "v2": "nonzero"]
